            <ul class="space-y-3 mt-4 flex-grow font-light text-neutral-300">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg> ปรับหน้านวม</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg> เปลี่ยนจุกไม้ก๊อก</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg> เปลี่ยนนวม</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg> ทำความสะอาดตัวเครื่อง</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg> เปลี่ยนสปริง</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg> รองก๊อกใหม่และเปลี่ยนสักหลาด</li>
